title: "ParametricWindProfiles: analysis code and processed data for a comparison of parametric TC wind profiles in the western North Pacific"
abstract: "Python code and processed JTWC/IBTrACS best-track derivatives that reproduce all tables and figures comparing seven parametric tropical cyclone wind profile models over the western North Pacific."
